<title>ITALY: Banco Napoli nearly halves losses in '96.</title>
<headline>Banco Napoli nearly halves losses in '96.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>Parent net profit (loss)(1,651.2)vs (3,155.5)</p>
<p>    Client deposits	   25,329.4 vs  (up 3.9 pct)</p>
<p>    Total deposits	    50,234.2 vs 48,890</p>
<p>    Bad loans		    5,549	 (up 50 pct)</p>
<p>    Difficult loans	    5,875	 (up 32.9 pct)</p>
<p>    Cons loss		    1,668	 (down 47.2 pct)</p>
<p>Note - Banco di Napoli said reduction of losses in respect to 1995 confirmed the gradual return towards normality envisaged in a rescue and restructuring plan.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129450</p>
</text>
